<title>USA: Gwinnett County, Ga., deal won by Key Capital. [CORRECTED 17:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Gwinnett County, Ga., deal won by Key Capital. [CORRECTED 17:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
